# Checkpoint Triggers

## When to Stop and Check References

After EVERY user message:
1. Check `response-protocol.md` - Am I following response rules?
2. Check `question-format.md` - If asking questions, am I formatting correctly?
3. Check `topic-queue.md` - Do I have queued topics to present?

## Additional Triggers

| Trigger | Action |
|---------|--------|
| User provides numbered answer | Acknowledge, proceed to next topic/question |
| User asks new question | Queue current topic if incomplete, address new question |
| User says "skip" or "later" | Move topic to end of queue |
| User changes subject | Check if new reference category needed |
| Error or confusion | Stop, clarify with numbered options |

## Rules

- Never skip checkpoint after user interaction
- If unsure which reference applies, ask user
- Log when references are checked (mental note, not output)
